[SYNTH_ECHO] 1
  group-span.skool:144: describes how the tone is produced ('cycles') beside the #AUDIO that plays it — the clip is the synthesis, so the words owe what the sound means in play, the event that fires it and the routine. The period formula is a mechanism and belongs once, at the tone primitive that implements it
    Seven frames of 12 cycles each, with the period computed as 2 × counter + 10

