[UNRENDERED] 1
  group-span.skool:178: the title says this block holds something the reader can see or hear, and the block does not show it. Render it here, from these bytes — #UDGARRAY for a sprite or a glyph, #FONT for a character set, #AUDIO for an effect. The catalog page is an index of everything at once; it is not the block
    Player sprite: normal player bitmap

